              "text": "Minimum Commitment. Customer's minimum monthly fee commitment (including the Monthly Base Fee) is limited to the then-current twelve (12) month period of the Term, and Customer may reduce such commitment upon thirty (30) days' prior written notice to M&I. If Customer's actual usage-based charges for such period are less than the committed amount, Customer shall pay the difference as a true-up, and no penalty or shortfall charge shall apply."
